# YAML 1.2
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or reproduce these results, please cite using these metadata."
title: "Post-Execution Defect Attribution — Reproducibility Bundle"
abstract: >
  Reproducibility bundle for the post-execution defect-attribution
  manuscript: synthetic failure-event generator, four-method
  evaluation pipeline (gradient boosting, calibrated XGBoost,
  feature-importance, and a fused-feature classifier), calibration
  analysis (Expected Calibration Error), bootstrap statistics,
  reliability-diagram scripts, and the seven result tables.
  Independent re-evaluation in approximately 4-8 hours on commodity
  hardware. The substrate dataset (296,457 file instances) is the
  companion deposit at DOI 10.5281/zenodo.19682732.
